  "description": "Hamilton ventilator OCR engine. Breath = display update of Compliance / VTE. OCR (selectable): VTE, Compliance, Ppeak, MinVol, P0.1, mode, set rate / ΔPinsp / PEEP / oxygen. Waveforms: Paw (Pressure), Flow, Volume, Pes with wrap-around sweep (50 px/s, 22 s per sweep on 1920x1080). Trigger: A (patient-triggered, pink triangle under the Paw time axis) / C (machine-triggered); a new triangle without a display update also starts a breath.",
